      "source": "<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>ExpressionDependencies</code></a> holding the given <a href=\"ExpressionDependencies.ExpressionDependency.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>dependencies</code></a> or\n        <a href=\"#none()\"><code>none</code></a> if the collection is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html#isEmpty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>empty</code></a>.</dd>",
