    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>root</code> - the SpEL expression to inspect.</dd>\n<dd><code>topLevelOnly</code> - whether to include top-level dependencies only. Top-level dependencies are dependencies that\n         indicate the start of a compound expression and required to resolve the next expression item.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a set of <a href=\"ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>ExpressionDependencies</code></a>.</dd>",
